{"3220700": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Timebound", "steam_appid": 3220700, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2a5f6d376b9d7c018c6ad479f870707a.avif?t=1780428114\" width=954 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts of the world are enchanted with timeloop magic. After several steps, you'll be sent back to where you entered. Discover the rules of the world and see how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5f758a0748be9fbdb53a6f432b23c58f.avif?t=1780428114\" width=954 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you a new rule about the world. There's no filler or chores, just a pure rule-discovery metroidBRAINIA experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/e4f802058af36b8acd4e230623f5c60e.avif?t=1780428114\" width=954 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress is only limited by your knowledge, not by artificial unlocks. What seemed impossible before might just need a second look. Yes, you could have done that the entire time!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Puzzle Design</strong> -  Solve puzzles by manipulating local timeloops in creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge-based Progression </strong> - Explore a world where your only limit is what you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; meta puzzles</strong> - Think outside the box to solve layered, interconnected puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Play at your own pace</strong> - Use the interactive hints, restart the puzzle whenever you want, save and load the game at any time.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/2a5f6d376b9d7c018c6ad479f870707a.avif?t=1780428114\" width=954 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/de4c578951be40a4b33d8470cd9932e3.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some parts of the world are enchanted with timeloop magic. After several steps, you'll be sent back to where you entered. Discover the rules of the world and see how far they can take you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5f758a0748be9fbdb53a6f432b23c58f.avif?t=1780428114\" width=954 height=120 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/4c4c0da3c4e9edfe40a9536183afdfc1.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every puzzle is handcrafted to teach you a new rule about the world. There's no filler or chores, just a pure rule-discovery metroidBRAINIA experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/e4f802058af36b8acd4e230623f5c60e.avif?t=1780428114\" width=954 height=120 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.poster.avif?t=1780428114\" width=608 height=204 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.webm?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/extras/5d7bb76338c472a9bc1460d2a88e2f08.mp4?t=1780428114\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your progress is only limited by your knowledge, not by artificial unlocks. What seemed impossible before might just need a second look. Yes, you could have done that the entire time!  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Puzzle Design</strong> -  Solve puzzles by manipulating local timeloops in creative ways.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Knowledge-based Progression </strong> - Explore a world where your only limit is what you know.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Secrets &amp; meta puzzles</strong> - Think outside the box to solve layered, interconnected puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <strong>Play at your own pace</strong> - Use the interactive hints, restart the puzzle whenever you want, save and load the game at any time.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "An exploration puzzle adventure in mystical ruins. Explore a world filled with puzzles, uncover the magic left behind, discover what's hidden in plain sight, learn the rules and break them.", "supported_languages": "English, French, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish, Italian, Ukrainian", "reviews": "“Well, dang! That was really freaking good!”<br>Icely Puzzles<br>", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/1413b315711affc3993acdfd5fee4957eea33b13/header.jpg?t=1780428114", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/02ae5f7f81776b4ed58d0fae66aa139cf3a4d76c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780428114", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3220700/02ae5f7f81776b4ed58d0fae66aa139cf3a4d76c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780428114", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> SSE2 instruction set support<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 256 MB NVidia or ATI graphics card, Intel HD Graphics 3000 or better<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Michal Klu